    "splashDescription": "The Zammad connector enables Camunda process automation to seamlessly interact with Zammad for managing support operations. It automates the creation, retrieval, update, and deletion of tickets, as well as searching for and creating users. The connector is ideal for automating IT service management, customer support, case management, and incident resolution processes.",
